<title>UK: Swiss Cantonalbanks sets 340 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss Cantonalbanks sets 340 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PFANDBRIEFZENTRALE DER SCHWEIZERISCHEN KANTONALBANKEN</p>
<p>		SERIES 309</p>
<p> AMT    340 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.625     MATURITY    15.JUL.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   28.MAY.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     DENOMS (K) 5-100-1M  VALOREN     636582</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
